# Line endings (5 Oct). The repo stores every text file with LF. On Windows
# the working copy is CRLF, and a Git client that does not apply
# core.autocrlf (some editors' built-in Git) then shows untouched files as
# modified. text=auto makes every client normalise the same way, whatever its
# own settings, so only real edits show up.
* text=auto

# Never touch these, whatever their contents look like.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx  binary
